{"code":"171120","name":"라이온켐텍","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건축자재","sector_desc":"시멘트·창호·인테리어 자재 등. 주택 착공과 건설 경기를 후행해서 따라갑니다.","desc":"동사는 1973년 설립 후 2013년에 코스닥에 상장된 화학물질 및 화학제품 제조 중견기업임. 건축 내외장재용 인조대리석과 플라스틱 물성 개선 합성왁스를 생산하고 있으며, 주력 제품으로 아크릴계 및 E-Stone 인조대리석, PE·PP 열분해 기반 합성왁스를 판매함. 인조대리석은 외장재, 광폭, 고부가가치 제품 개발을 하고 있으며, 합성왁스는 다분산성, 기능성 왁스 개발로 신규 시장을 확대하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":2015.0,"open":2015.0,"high":2020.0,"low":1995.0,"volume":16607,"amount":33463105.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":1.2407,"ret_5":0.4988,"ret_20":0.4988,"ret_60":0.4988,"ret_120":-6.713,"ret_250":-8.4091,"ma20":2008.65,"ma60":2013.65,"ma120":2119.2583,"ma200":2116.895,"close_vs_ma200":-4.8134,"close_vs_ma60":0.067,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-0.5507,"r2_60":0.0006,"slope_120":-36.9651,"r2_120":0.5145,"slope_250":-6.5774,"r2_250":0.091,"high52":3650.0,"low52":1863.0,"pos_52w":8.5059,"dd_52w":-44.7945,"mdd_1y":-35.1111,"atr14_pct":1.6519,"vol_ann_60":16.5599,"vol_avg20":37907.2,"vol_ratio20":0.4381,"vr5":0.5389,"vr20":0.0846,"amount_avg5":50130875.8,"amount_avg20":75995078.85,"amount_avg60":88085744.9167,"obv_chg20":-5.1406,"turnover_20":2.1117,"pv_eff_20":0.2362,"rsi14":51.0685,"frgn_net_5":3519.0,"inst_net_5":9816.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0098,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0273,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0371,"frgn_net_20":-81758.0,"inst_net_20":123.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.2277,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0003,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.2274,"frgn_net_60":87296.0,"inst_net_60":10723.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.2432,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0299,"smart_net_60_pct":0.273,"frgn_net_120":99549.0,"inst_net_120":1644.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.2773,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0046,"smart_net_120_pct":0.2819,"foreign_ratio":2.96,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.39,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":52.0,"op_margin_q":12.381,"op_qoq":23.8095,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":1.9608,"rev_yoy":9.375,"op_trend_4q":4.2938,"fin_period":"202606","roe":12.13,"debt_ratio":16.81,"per":4.33,"pbr":0.49,"div_yield":4.96,"foreign_r